WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.106
The core contribution brings Score-based Likelihood
Characterization, or SLIC,

00:00:05.186 --> 00:00:06.636
to gravitational waves.

00:00:06.716 --> 00:00:09.694
Originally developed for astronomical imaging,

00:00:09.774 --> 00:00:16.211
it learns the score of the noise distribution with
a diffusion model instead of assuming its form.

00:00:16.291 --> 00:00:21.065
Coupled with a differentiable waveform, it yields
an unbiased likelihood.

00:00:21.145 --> 00:00:27.980
They show it both generates realistic LIGO noise
and recovers the true parameters of an injected signal.
